    "title": "Mid-Level Investment Banker at Acuite Ratings Holdings Services",
    "description": "Acuite Ratings Holdings Services invites applications from qualified candidates for the position of Investment Banker at our Chandigarh location. This role offers excellent career advancement prospects.\n\nAbout Acuite Ratings Holdings Services:\nAcuite Ratings Holdings Services is a leading organization in the On-site sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Coordinate with external auditors during annual audits\n• Prepare annual reports and investor presentations\n• Ensure compliance with tax regulations and statutory requirements\n• Process payroll and manage employee reimbursements\n• Implement and maintain internal controls and audit procedures\n• Monitor market trends and provide investment recommendations\n• Prepare MIS reports for senior management review\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• B.Tech / B.E. in Computer Science or related discipline\n• 3-6 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in Budgeting\n• Proficiency in Python for Finance\n• Proficiency in SAP FICO\n• Proficiency in Bloomberg Terminal\n• Proficiency in GST\n• Proficiency in Forecasting\n• Proficiency in MS Excel\n• Proficiency in IFRS\n\nWork Mode: On-site - Work from our office\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Flexible working hours\n• Competitive salary with performance-linked incentives\n• Comprehensive health insurance for self and family\n• Work-from-home flexibility\n• Provident Fund and Gratuity as per company policy\n• Professional development and training programs\n• Salary Range: 7 LPA - 15 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Chandigarh, Punjab, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Acuite Ratings Holdings Services!",
